{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1060394/block/singleImage/3249017/wm/01KR2YJMWBFAA9NNJJ90QSASAD.jpeg?updatedAt=1793012135\"/><figcaption>粉嶺河壩村兩男噪音爭執，一人持鐮刀毀單車傷人被捕。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (26 日 ) 上午 11 時 44 分，警方接獲一名 42 歲姓吳男子報案，指在粉嶺河霸村一村屋外與另一名男子就噪音問題爭執，期間被對方以一把鐮刀損壞單車，其手部及其手機亦被擊中。 人員接報到場，經初步調查，該名 47 歲姓李男子涉嫌傷人及刑事毀壞被捕，現正被扣留調查，吳男則清醒被送往北區醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.887233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:55:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.250164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:13.306742+00:00","content_hash":"9710c36ce6abb44234dcd3d073fb136e6833cbec3232e0d629a018ddf63d3ddf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.887233+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}